                                                "sense_id": "d35b32df-1a65-38ac-a433-6b1da448f8be",
                                                "text": "“Get away from me, freak.” “Actually, my designation is Logic-y. I take issue with the pejorative when I am simply a product of your self-inflicted bifurcation.”"
